  "description": "吃饭（Eat）—— 给 Coopanion 桌宠的 cortico World 扩展：饱食度、米仓、电饭煲，外加一块水稻田、一个水池和虫灾鸟灾；桌宠用工具做饭、吃饭、种田、立稻草人，主人在控制台厨房/稻田面板直接操作；煮饭和水稻都要时间，下雨会替田里浇水，鸟先吃虫再吃稻子。 / A cortico World extension with satiety, a rice bin, a rice cooker, one rice paddy, a water pool, pests and birds: the pet cooks, eats, farms and puts up scarecrows with tools, the owner uses the console panels; cooking and rice growth both take time, rain waters the field, and birds eat the pests before turning on the crop.",
